 ${misc:Depends},
Description: metapackage for QuadRF Mesh application
 Metapackage pulling in the QuadRF LoRa-compatible PHY daemon, the Meshtastic
 daemon adapter, desktop launcher, and web control panel integration.
 .
 This independent experimental package is not an official Scale RF or
 Meshtastic product or support channel.
